---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConversionActions from '../components/ConversionActions.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="How a PostgreSQL investigation works | WalStack" description="Start with a free snapshot. If you need more, get a diagnosis in three business days, a review call and a check 14 days later.">
  <header class="container hero"><h1>From a slow page to a fix you can check.</h1><p class="lede">You choose what to share and when to make a change. I investigate and write down how to test the result.</p><ConversionActions /></header>
  <section><div class="container prose"><h2>Start with the free snapshot</h2>
    <p>You run a read-only script and inspect the output. I send 3 written findings within 2 business days.</p>
    <h2>Dig into one slowdown</h2><p>The <a href="/postgresql-performance-investigation">paid investigation</a> costs {site.investigationOffer.display}. You can grant a read-only role or run the scripts yourself. I deliver the report in 3 business days after access or receipt of your output.</p>
    <h2>Make and measure the change</h2><p>I explain the proposed changes, risks and rollback steps on a 45-minute call. Your engineers choose what to apply. I follow up 14 days later to compare the results.</p>
    <p><a href="/sample-report">See the report format</a>. This example uses demo data.</p><ConversionActions />
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
